rch 31, 2021 is Rs.61.68 instead of Rs. 61.56 calculated as per table.       7. EPS for the Quarter ended 31.03.2021 from Continuing operations, Discontinued operations and Continuing and Discontinued operations is not annualised.      OCI Segment:   8. Income tax relating items that will not be classified to Profit or loss includes income tax relating to items that will not be reclassified to Profit or loss from Continuing operations and Discontinued operations</in-bse-fin:DisclosureOfNotesOnFinancialResultsExplanatoryTextBlock>
